# Normalizes line endings for anyone who clones fresh. On a Windows machine
# with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default), tracked text files
# get CRLF on checkout - which is why .prettierrc sets endOfLine: "auto"
# rather than relying on this alone. Discovered while verifying Node 24
# compatibility; unrelated to Node version itself (reproduced identically
# on Node 24 and Node 25). See STATE.md's gotcha on this.
* text=auto eol=lf
